# token_fps.map: account name -> expected OAuth token fingerprint (sha256 of the token with its
# trailing newline stripped, first 12 hex; the same fp the launchers stamp as auth_fp).
#
# THIS FILE IS THE ONE PLACE to update after an OAuth token rotation (orch-console #49107).
# scripts/lib/token_file_guard.sh (launchers, switch tools, boot scripts) and
# scripts/lib/token_file_guard.py (weekly_limit_monitor) both read it, so every reader of a key
# file named <acct>-oauth-token refuses it if it does not hash to the fp below. A post-rotation
# refusal therefore says "fp map out of date OR file mislabelled": update the line here.
# Fingerprints are hashes, not secrets.
#
# <acct>   <fp12>
musa       68142948c003
musa2      e1dfa48eec85
syed       582043088eae
